#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2210
msgid ""
"``PATH`` environment variable to get the program full path "
"(from :c:member:`PyConfig.program_name`)"
msgstr ""
"``PATH`` 環境変数: :c:member:`PyConfig.program_name` からプログラムの完全なパ"
"スを取得するために使います。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2212
msgid "``__PYVENV_LAUNCHER__`` environment variable"
msgstr "``__PYVENV_LAUNCHER__`` 環境変数"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2213
msgid ""
"(Windows only) Application paths in the registry under "
"\"Software\\Python\\PythonCore\\X.Y\\PythonPath\" of HKEY_CURRENT_USER and "
"HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE (where X.Y is the Python version)."
msgstr ""
"Windows のみ: レジストリの HKEY_CURRENT_USER と HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE の "
"\"Software\\Python\\PythonCore\\X.Y\\PythonPath\" にあるアプリケーションのパ"
"ス (X.Y は Python のバージョン)。"

