msgid ":c:member:`PyConfig.exec_prefix`"
msgstr ":c:member:`PyConfig.exec_prefix`"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2223
msgid ":c:member:`PyConfig.executable`"
msgstr ":c:member:`PyConfig.executable`"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2224
msgid ":c:member:`PyConfig.module_search_paths_set`, :c:member:`PyConfig.module_search_paths`"
msgstr ":c:member:`PyConfig.module_search_paths_set`, :c:member:`PyConfig.module_search_paths`"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2226
msgid ":c:member:`PyConfig.prefix`"
msgstr ":c:member:`PyConfig.prefix`"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2228
msgid ""
"If at least one \"output field\" is not set, Python calculates the path "
"configuration to fill unset fields. "
"If :c:member:`~PyConfig.module_search_paths_set` is equal to "
"``0``, :c:member:`~PyConfig.module_search_paths` is overridden "
"and :c:member:`~PyConfig.module_search_paths_set` is set to ``1``."
msgstr ""
"「出力フィールド」が 1 つでも未設定なら、Python はパス設定を計算して未設定の"
"フィールドを埋めます。\n"
":c:member:`~PyConfig.module_search_paths_set` が ``0`` の場合"
"は、:c:member:`~PyConfig.module_search_paths` を上書き"
"し、:c:member:`~PyConfig.module_search_paths_set` を ``1`` に設定します。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2234
msgid ""
"It is possible to completely ignore the function calculating the default "
"path configuration by setting explicitly all path configuration output "
"fields listed above. A string is considered as set even if it is non-empty. "
"``module_search_paths`` is considered as set if ``module_search_paths_set`` "
"is set to ``1``. In this case, ``module_search_paths`` will be used without "
"modification."
msgstr ""

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2241
msgid ""
"Set :c:member:`~PyConfig.pathconfig_warnings` to ``0`` to suppress warnings "
"when calculating the path configuration (Unix only, Windows does not log any "
"warning)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2244
msgid ""
"If :c:member:`~PyConfig.base_prefix` "
"or :c:member:`~PyConfig.base_exec_prefix` fields are not set, they inherit "
"their value from :c:member:`~PyConfig.prefix` "
"and :c:member:`~PyConfig.exec_prefix` respectively."
msgstr ""
":c:member:`~PyConfig.base_prefix` と :c:member:`~PyConfig.base_exec_prefix` "
"は、それぞれ未設定なら :c:member:`~PyConfig.prefix` "
"と :c:member:`~PyConfig.exec_prefix` の値を引き継ぎます。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2248
msgid ":c:func:`Py_RunMain` and :c:func:`Py_Main` modify :data:`sys.path`:"
msgstr ""
":c:func:`Py_RunMain` と :c:func:`Py_Main` は :data:`sys.path` を変更します。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2250
msgid ""
"If :c:member:`~PyConfig.run_filename` is set and is a directory which "
"contains a ``__main__.py`` script, "
"prepend :c:member:`~PyConfig.run_filename` to :data:`sys.path`."
msgstr ""
":c:member:`~PyConfig.run_filename` が設定されており、``__main__.py`` スクリプ"
"トを含むディレクトリである場合は、:c:member:`~PyConfig.run_filename` "
"を :data:`sys.path` の先頭に追加します。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2253
msgid "If :c:member:`~PyConfig.isolated` is zero:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2255
msgid ""
"If :c:member:`~PyConfig.run_module` is set, prepend the current directory "
"to :data:`sys.path`. Do nothing if the current directory cannot be read."
msgstr ""
":c:member:`~PyConfig.run_module` が設定されている場合は、現在のディレクトリ"
"を :data:`sys.path` の先頭に追加します。\n"
"現在のディレクトリを取得できなければ何もしません。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2257
msgid ""
"If :c:member:`~PyConfig.run_filename` is set, prepend the directory of the "
"filename to :data:`sys.path`."
msgstr ""
":c:member:`~PyConfig.run_filename` が設定されている場合は、そのファイル名の"
"ディレクトリを :data:`sys.path` の先頭に追加します。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2259
msgid "Otherwise, prepend an empty string to :data:`sys.path`."
msgstr "それ以外の場合は、空文字列を :data:`sys.path` の先頭に追加します。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2261
msgid ""
"If :c:member:`~PyConfig.site_import` is non-zero, :data:`sys.path` can be "
"modified by the :mod:`site` module. "
"If :c:member:`~PyConfig.user_site_directory` is non-zero and the user's site-"
"package directory exists, the :mod:`site` module appends the user's site-"
"package directory to :data:`sys.path`."
msgstr ""
":c:member:`~PyConfig.site_import` がゼロ以外の場合、:mod:`site` モジュール"
"が :data:`sys.path` を変更することがあります。\n"
":c:member:`~PyConfig.user_site_directory` がゼロ以外で、ユーザーの site-"
"packages ディレクトリが存在する場合は、:mod:`site` モジュールがそのディレクト"
"リを :data:`sys.path` の末尾に追加します。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2267
msgid "The following configuration files are used by the path configuration:"
msgstr "パス設定では、以下の設定ファイルを使います。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2269
msgid "``pyvenv.cfg``"
msgstr "``pyvenv.cfg``"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2270
msgid "``._pth`` file (ex: ``python._pth``)"
msgstr "``._pth`` ファイル (例: ``python._pth``)"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2271
msgid "``pybuilddir.txt`` (Unix only)"
msgstr "``pybuilddir.txt`` (Unix のみ)"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2273
msgid "If a ``._pth`` file is present:"
msgstr "``._pth`` ファイルが存在する場合:"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2275
msgid "Set :c:member:`~PyConfig.isolated` to ``1``."
msgstr ":c:member:`~PyConfig.isolated` を ``1`` に設定します。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2276
msgid "Set :c:member:`~PyConfig.use_environment` to ``0``."
msgstr ":c:member:`~PyConfig.use_environment` を ``0`` に設定します。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2277
msgid "Set :c:member:`~PyConfig.site_import` to ``0``."
msgstr ":c:member:`~PyConfig.site_import` を ``0`` に設定します。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2278
msgid "Set :c:member:`~PyConfig.safe_path` to ``1``."
msgstr ":c:member:`~PyConfig.safe_path` を ``1`` に設定します。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2280
msgid ""
"If :c:member:`~PyConfig.home` is not set and a ``pyvenv.cfg`` file is "
"present in the same directory as :c:member:`~PyConfig.executable`, or its "
"parent, :c:member:`~PyConfig.prefix` and :c:member:`~PyConfig.exec_prefix` "
"are set that location. When this happens, :c:member:`~PyConfig.base_prefix` "
"and :c:member:`~PyConfig.base_exec_prefix` still keep their value, pointing "
"to the base installation. See :ref:`sys-path-init-virtual-environments` for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
":c:member:`~PyConfig.home` が未設定で、:c:member:`~PyConfig.executable` と同"
"じディレクトリか、その親ディレクトリに ``pyvenv.cfg`` ファイルがある場"
"合、:c:member:`~PyConfig.prefix` と :c:member:`~PyConfig.exec_prefix` はその"
"場所に設定されます。\n"
"この場合も、:c:member:`~PyConfig.base_prefix` "
"と :c:member:`~PyConfig.base_exec_prefix` は元の値を保ち、基となるインストー"
"ル先を指します。\n"
"詳しくは :ref:`sys-path-init-virtual-environments` を参照してください。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2288
msgid ""
"The ``__PYVENV_LAUNCHER__`` environment variable is used to "
"set :c:member:`PyConfig.base_executable`."
msgstr ""
"``__PYVENV_LAUNCHER__`` 環境変数は、:c:member:`PyConfig.base_executable` の設"
"定に使います。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2293
msgid ""
":c:member:`~PyConfig.prefix`, and :c:member:`~PyConfig.exec_prefix`, are now "
"set to the ``pyvenv.cfg`` directory. This was previously done "
"by :mod:`site`, therefore affected by :option:`-S`."
msgstr ""
":c:member:`~PyConfig.prefix` と :c:member:`~PyConfig.exec_prefix` が、"
"``pyvenv.cfg`` のディレクトリに設定されるようになりました。\n"
"以前は :mod:`site` が設定していたため、:option:`-S` の影響を受けていました。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2299
msgid "Py_GetArgcArgv()"
msgstr "Py_GetArgcArgv()"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2303
msgid "Get the original command line arguments, before Python modified them."
msgstr "Python が変更する前の、元のコマンドライン引数を取得します。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2305
msgid "See also :c:member:`PyConfig.orig_argv` member."
msgstr ":c:member:`PyConfig.orig_argv` メンバーも参照してください。"

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2308
msgid "Delaying main module execution"
msgstr ""

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2310
msgid ""
"In some embedding use cases, it may be desirable to separate interpreter "
"initialization from the execution of the main module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2313
msgid ""
"This separation can be achieved by setting ``PyConfig.run_command`` to the "
"empty string during initialization (to prevent the interpreter from dropping "
"into the interactive prompt), and then subsequently executing the desired "
"main module code using ``__main__.__dict__`` as the global namespace."
msgstr ""

